      "cooked": "<p>So ... KNYFE's card says Agent of Filter (admittedly, crossed out) .... however</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does that make her an Agent?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does she benifit from Lock Down, Warden Hoeffle, and isnt target by other agents who say 'Non Agent Card'? Can the Rogue destroy her at the start of the environment turn?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm guessing this is not the case but... its still amusing to play that way.</p>",
