      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nielzabub\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/48/1986_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nielzabub:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's the same issue as the issue of whether or not Golemn Unity should be healed by Inspired Repair. Although that would be thematically appropriate, Hero cards don't have keywords and can not be affected by things that don't specifically target Heroes or Hero targets.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Villain characters have keywords, why not heroes? I, too, would like to see Mechanical Golem on Golem Unity and Agent on KNYFE. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
